WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.794
A Zenuo, a Dagara pipi soabã. Ned sẽn da yaa ned ning sẽn lugl-a tẽngã.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.698
A Zenuo ra yaa zabd. A ra mii weoogã sõma n yɩɩd ned baa a yen.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.064
Bũmb a to sẽn be tẽn-gãongã poorẽ.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.900
Roagdbã sẽn da be tẽn-kãng pʋgẽ wã, b ra pa leb n wʋmd taab pʋʋg pʋse wɛɛngẽ ye.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.648
Ka yãmb pʋʋgã ye!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.500
Bɩ d kẽng.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.468
Bɩ d kẽng n tɩ bao tõnd tẽngã.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.592
A Zenuo ne a pagã, a Nyolé, rɩka b teedã la b zaklã.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.400
B kẽnga zĩ-kãng pʋgẽ rasem wʋsgo.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.416
La yʋngo, b ra bee bugum sɛɛgẽ n get ãdsã.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.456
Daar a ye, koom-koglg sẽn yaa kãseng n da be b sorẽ wã.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.600
A Zenuo maana koom-koglgã, la b kẽe koomẽ wã.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:11.178
Tẽngã sẽn da be tẽn-zẽngã, bũmb fãa ra yaa toor fasɩ. B pa wẽnemd b poorẽ ye.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.378
La zĩ-bʋs la d tõe n bas-a? A Zenuo ra gũuda makrã.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.952
Rẽ poore, tɩɩg-kãsenga zug n sɩng n gilgdẽ.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.734
Yaa be, a Nyolé. Yaa be bala.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:05.026
A Zenuo zẽka a boogã tɩɩgã tẽngre. Rẽ n so t'a Zeova na n kɩtame tɩ d vɩɩmd wakat sẽn kõn sa.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.840
La bãmb ne b saam-biisã maana raag n segl pʋʋg ning sẽn dengã.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.432
Neb a taab n wa, tɩ b me zĩnd be.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.658
Bi-ribla rogame. Tẽngã sɩngame.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.464
Bãngr-gomdã yetame tɩ yaa woto la b dog a Zeno nebã.
